---
// Hero.astro - Atmospheric Alpine Hero Section
---
<section class="relative min-h-[90vh] lg:min-h-[92vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#070e18] text-white pt-12 pb-20 sm:pb-24">
  
  <!-- Atmospheric Alpine Background Image & Ambient Gradients -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat opacity-45 mix-blend-luminosity scale-105 transform transition-transform duration-1000" style="background-image: url('/позадина.webp');"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a1322]/80 via-[#070e18]/70 to-[#f5f8fc]"></div>
  
  <!-- Ambient Glow Spheres -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 sm:w-[650px] sm:h-[650px] bg-sky-500/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-72 h-72 bg-orange-500/15 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Content Container -->
  <div class="relative z-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- Top Pill Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-300 mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-sky-950/50 hover:bg-white/15 transition-all">
      <span class="text-base">🏔️</span>
      <span data-i18n="hero_pill">Опрема директно на скијачката патека Пониква</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline with Gradient Accent -->
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight max-w-4xl leading-[1.1] mb-6">
      <span data-i18n="hero_title_1" class="text-white block">Вашата незаборавна</span>
      <span data-i18n="hero_title_2" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 via-sky-400 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent block">
        зимска авантура
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle Description -->
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal mb-10" data-i18n="hero_desc">
      Врвна ски и сноуборд опрема, дезинфицирана и прецизно прилагодена на вашата висина и број. Без носење тежок багаж — земете ја опремата веднаш на стартот на патеката!
    </p>

    <!-- Dual Action Buttons -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 sm:gap-5 w-full sm:w-auto mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <a href="#contact" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 via-orange-500 to-amber-500 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-amber-600 text-white font-bold text-base sm:text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-xl shadow-orange-500/30 hover:shadow-orange-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <span>🎿</span>
        <span data-i18n="hero_cta_book">Резервирај Опрема</span>
      </a>

      <a href="#equipment" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 hover:border-white/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <span>❄️</span>
        <span data-i18n="hero_cta_explore">Погледни ја Опремата</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 High-Impact Stat / Highlight Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full text-left">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          📍
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-white mb-1" data-i18n="hl1_t">На самиот старт</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-snug" data-i18n="hl1_d">Директно до лифтот, 0 метри носење</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          ⏱️
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-white mb-1" data-i18n="hl2_t">Брзо прилагодување</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-snug" data-i18n="hl2_d">Чизми, везови и шлемови за 5 минути</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          ♨️
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-white mb-1" data-i18n="hl3_t">Греени & Суви Чизми</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-snug" data-i18n="hl3_d">Секој пар е сув, топол и дезинфициран</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          👨‍👩‍👧‍👦
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-white mb-1" data-i18n="hl4_t">За Сите Возрасти</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-snug" data-i18n="hl4_d">Скии, бордови, санки и опрема за деца</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
